fix(tests): resolve missing table errors by fixing migration execution

- Renamed `tenant` migration folders to ensure their timestamps do not collide with `system` migrations. Previously, Diesel skipped `tenant` migrations entirely because they had the same timestamp as `system` migrations, leading to missing tables (e.g. `users`, `employees`) during test execution.
- Updated `setup-test-env.sh` to replace `sqlx migrate run` (which failed silently without `apiserver/migrations/*.sql` files) with the dedicated `setup_migrations` test binary using Diesel. This correctly populates the `leeattend_test_template` database for fast, isolated parallel testing.
